; Section 1: Problem Statement & Why We Made It (0:00 - 0:22.7)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Most educational AI platforms today fail students because they instantly give away final answers...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...without diagnosing underlying cognitive misconceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:17.50,Highlight,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}That is why we built NeuroTeach AI: an adaptive pedagogical learning companion...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,200)}...powered by Misconception DNA, anti-leakage guardrails, and a fine-tuned Qwen 3.5 4B LoRA adapter.

; Section 2: Home Dashboard & Markov Failure-State Policy (0:22.7 - 0:35.9)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}On the Home Dashboard, our Markov Failure-State Policy continuously prioritizes personalized interventions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,200)}It tracks daily learning goals, streaks, and an evidence-based Misconception Ledger.

; Section 3: Socratic Dialogue & Misconception Diagnosis (0:35.9 - 0:49.8)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}In Ask Neuro, our core Socratic engine diagnoses the exact conceptual bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,200)}When a student misapplies the vertex formula, the tutor identifies sign neglect and offers a counterexample instead of leaking the answer.

; Section 4: Dynamic Custom Question ("What is photosynthesis?") (0:49.8 - 1:05.4)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:56.50,Highlight,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}NeuroTeach AI is never locked to canned questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:01:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,200)}By clicking Change Question, evaluators can ask any custom problem—such as what is photosynthesis or binary search invariants—and receive structured Socratic discovery questions.

; Section 5: Practice Arena & Visual Pattern Lab (1:05.4 - 1:16.1)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Practice Arena features an interactive Visual Pattern Lab with sub-fifty-millisecond coordinate re-rendering, paired with a browser-native voice assistant for auditory reinforcement.

; Section 6: Learning Sessions & Roleplay Teach-back Viva (1:16.1 - 1:25.4)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Learning Sessions tab audits longitudinal dialogue turns, while the Roleplay module offers teach-back viva simulations to prove oral mastery.

; Section 7: Subject Roadmap & Bayesian Mastery Evaluator (1:25.4 - 1:37.3)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Our Subject Roadmap visualizes prerequisite concept dependencies, complemented by an interactive Mind Map and a Bayesian Mastery Evaluator across near, medium, and far transfer.

; Section 8: Dark Theme & Production Deployment (1:37.3 - 1:47.9)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:47.90,Highlight,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}Engineered with seamless Dark and Light themes and thirty-nine passing tests, NeuroTeach AI is live and ready for evaluation at neuroteach-ai.vercel.app.
